      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (frontend, ImFusion Web Portal, fe/ rewrite)",
      "**Trusted repo**: /Users/brunner/repos/imfusion/cp/imfusion-portal-CP-89/fe and its remote ssh://bitbucket.imfusion.com:7999/cp/imfusion-portal.git",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: tanstack (Tanstack docs CLI, per global CLAUDE.md), agent-browser",
      "**routine under brunner/ prefix**: routine developer workflow under /Users/brunner/repos/imfusion/ (npm, npx, tanstack, git) is expected"
    ]
  },
  "voiceEnabled": true,
  "feedbackSurveyState": {
    "lastShownTime": 1754313915132
  },
  "mcpServers": {}
}
